<title>USA: Quad Systems sees lower gross margins.</title>
<headline>Quad Systems sees lower gross margins.</headline>
<dateline>HORSHAM, Pa. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quad Systems Corp said on Tuesday that it expects a decrease in gross margins during the first half of fiscal 1997, on increased shipments of new products and softer market conditions.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company reported gross margin for the fourth quarter at 39 percent, up from 34.8 percent in the fourth quarter of 1995 but lower than 39.9 percent in the third quarter.</p>
</text>
